| 入口与来源 | [12项原始结构化入口结果](../../../../../.work/performance/20260907T104001Z-141eee8d/edge-path-preflight.json)PASS；[64次顺序HEAD](../../../../../.work/performance/20260907T104001Z-141eee8d/source-ip-preflight.json)客户端真实socket来源与服务端逐源吻合，等待5秒flush、不重发 |
